WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.320
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind my technology project.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:11.115
Plan: identifies steps and materials before work. Design: shows how the finished

00:00:11.115 --> 00:00:12.344
result should look.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:18.747
Create: builds the digital product. Test: checks that the product works as intended.

00:00:18.747 --> 00:00:20.880
Improve: makes changes using feedback.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:26.891
Design a simple paper model explaining plan, design and create. Trade models with a

00:00:26.891 --> 00:00:29.487
classmate and explain how your design works.
